	(descr "Sipeed Tang Nano 20K module, 54.04 x 22.55 mm, 2 x 20 pins on 2.54, rows 20.32 apart, pad 1 = pin 73 (HSPI_DIN2) at the USB-C end; USB-C 2 mm and HDMI about 4 mm past the ends (data sheet v1.3 p.3-6); soldered on pin headers 2.5 mm above the board, no sockets; in v2.0 only pins 5, 7, 8, 20, 21, 22, 25, 35, 40 have pads: the seven that carry something and one at each corner they leave bare; the header strips are cut to them")
